{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-89340","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-152947","text":"webhost.systems — [&] Protocol Integration Spec (v1)"}]},{"id":"blk-89341","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-152948","text":"Version: 1.0 Status: Draft Audience: Engineering Last updated: 2026-03-28"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-89343","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-152949","text":"This document extends the v1 spec to make WebHost.Systems the canonical hosting layer for [&] Protocol agents."}]}],"id":"blk-89342","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-89344","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-152950","text":"0) Context"}]},{"id":"blk-89345","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-152951","text":"WebHost.Systems currently treats agents as opaque code bundles deployed to Cloudflare Workers or AWS AgentCore. To serve as the hosting platform for the [&] Protocol ecosystem, WHS must understand "},{"id":"spn-152952","marks":["bold"],"text":"capability declarations"},{"id":"spn-152953","text":", "},{"id":"spn-152954","marks":["bold"],"text":"MCP sidecar orchestration"},{"id":"spn-152955","text":", "},{"id":"spn-152956","marks":["bold"],"text":"agent-to-agent skill routing"},{"id":"spn-152957","text":", and "},{"id":"spn-152958","marks":["bold"],"text":"governance enforcement"},{"id":"spn-152959","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-89346","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-152960","text":"This spec adds [&]-aware features as phased extensions to the existing v1 architecture. The current CRUD/deploy/invoke/telemetry foundation remains intact."}]},{"id":"blk-89347","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-152961","text":"1) Capability Manifests (ampersand.json)"}]},{"id":"blk-89348","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-152962","text":"1.1 Problem"}]},{"id":"blk-89349","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-152963","text":"Agents currently declare only "},{"id":"spn-152964","marks":["code"],"text":"name"},{"id":"spn-152965","text":", "},{"id":"spn-152966","marks":["code"],"text":"description"},{"id":"spn-152967","text":", "},{"id":"spn-152968","marks":["code"],"text":"framework"},{"id":"spn-152969","text":", and "},{"id":"spn-152970","marks":["code"],"text":"runtimeProvider"},{"id":"spn-152971","text":". There is no way for the platform to know what capabilities an agent uses ("},{"id":"spn-152972","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-152973","text":", "},{"id":"spn-152974","marks":["code"],"text":"&time.anomaly"},{"id":"spn-152975","text":", etc.) or what it provides."}]},{"id":"blk-89350","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-152976","text":"1.2 Solution"}]},{"id":"blk-89351","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-152977","text":"Support an optional "},{"id":"spn-152978","marks":["code"],"text":"ampersand.json"},{"id":"spn-152979","text":" manifest alongside the agent code bundle. When present, WHS validates it against the [&] Protocol schema and uses it for:"}]},{"id":"blk-89352","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-89354","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-152980","text":"Capability-aware deployment (auto-provision required MCP sidecars)"}]}],"id":"blk-89353","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-89356","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-152981","text":"FleetPrompt registry integration (publish agent capabilities)"}]}],"id":"blk-89355","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-89358","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-152982","text":"Governance enforcement (Delegatic policy checks)"}]}],"id":"blk-89357","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-89359","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-152983","text":"1.3 Schema"}]},{"id":"blk-89360","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-152984","text":"The manifest follows "},{"id":"spn-152985","marks":["code"],"text":"AmpersandBoxDesign/protocol/schema/v0.1.0/ampersand.schema.json"},{"id":"spn-152986","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-89361","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-152987","text":"Key fields for WHS:"}]},{"id":"blk-89362","kind":"code","language":"json","text":"{\n  \"agent\": \"my-agent\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"capabilities\": {\n    \"uses\": [\"&memory.graph\", \"&time.anomaly\", \"&reason.deliberate\"],\n    \"provides\": [\"&space.fleet.locate\"]\n  },\n  \"providers\": {\n    \"&memory.graph\": { \"provider\": \"graphonomous\", \"config\": { \"db\": \"auto\" } },\n    \"&time.anomaly\": { \"provider\": \"ticktickclock\" },\n    \"&reason.deliberate\": { \"provider\": \"auto\" }\n  },\n  \"governance\": {\n    \"autonomy\": \"advise\",\n    \"constraints\": { \"hard\": [\"no_network_without_approval\"], \"soft\": [] }\n  },\n  \"mcp_servers\": [\"graphonomous\", \"ticktickclock\"]\n}"},{"id":"blk-89363","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-152988","text":"1.4 Data Model Extension"}]},{"id":"blk-89364","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-152989","text":"Add to "},{"id":"spn-152990","marks":["code"],"text":"agents"},{"id":"spn-152991","text":" table:"}]},{"id":"blk-89365","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"ampersandManifest: optional JSON blob (validated against schema on deploy)\ncapabilitiesUsed: optional string[] (denormalized from manifest for search/filter)\ncapabilitiesProvided: optional string[] (denormalized for registry)"},{"id":"blk-89366","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-152992","text":"1.5 Validation"}]},{"id":"blk-89367","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-152993","text":"On deployment, if "},{"id":"spn-152994","marks":["code"],"text":"ampersand.json"},{"id":"spn-152995","text":" is present in the bundle:"}]},{"id":"blk-89368","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-89370","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-152996","text":"Validate against [&] schema (reuse "},{"id":"spn-152997","marks":["code"],"text":"@ampersand-protocol/validate"},{"id":"spn-152998","text":" npm package)"}]}],"id":"blk-89369","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-89372","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-152999","text":"Extract "},{"id":"spn-153000","marks":["code"],"text":"capabilities.uses"},{"id":"spn-153001","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-153002","marks":["code"],"text":"capabilities.provides"}]}],"id":"blk-89371","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-89374","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153003","text":"Verify all declared providers are available in the deployment environment"}]}],"id":"blk-89373","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-89376","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153004","text":"Store validated manifest in "},{"id":"spn-153005","marks":["code"],"text":"agents.ampersandManifest"}]}],"id":"blk-89375","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-89377","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-153006","text":"2) MCP Sidecar Orchestration"}]},{"id":"blk-89378","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-153007","text":"2.1 Problem"}]},{"id":"blk-89379","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153008","text":"[&] agents compose capabilities via MCP servers (Graphonomous for "},{"id":"spn-153009","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory"},{"id":"spn-153010","text":", TickTickClock for "},{"id":"spn-153011","marks":["code"],"text":"&time"},{"id":"spn-153012","text":", etc.). Currently WHS deploys agents in isolation with no MCP server connectivity."}]},{"id":"blk-89380","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-153013","text":"2.2 Solution"}]},{"id":"blk-89381","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153014","marks":["bold"],"text":"Phase 1 — Linked MCP services"},{"id":"spn-153015","text":": Allow agents to declare MCP server dependencies. WHS provisions and manages these as linked services (similar to linked databases in PaaS platforms)."}]},{"id":"blk-89382","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153016","marks":["bold"],"text":"Phase 2 — MCP sidecar model"},{"id":"spn-153017","text":": For Cloudflare Workers, run MCP servers as Durable Object sidecars. For AgentCore, use linked Lambda/container sidecars."}]},{"id":"blk-89383","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-153018","text":"2.3 Configuration"}]},{"id":"blk-89384","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153019","text":"In "},{"id":"spn-153020","marks":["code"],"text":"ampersand.json"},{"id":"spn-153021","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-89385","kind":"code","language":"json","text":"{\n  \"mcp_servers\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"graphonomous\",\n      \"transport\": \"streamable_http\",\n      \"config\": {\n        \"db_path\": \"auto\",\n        \"embedder_backend\": \"fallback\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}"},{"id":"blk-89386","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-153022","text":"2.4 Data Model Extension"}]},{"id":"blk-89387","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153023","text":"New table: "},{"id":"spn-153024","marks":["code"],"text":"linkedServices"}]},{"id":"blk-89388","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"agentId: Id<\"agents\">\nserviceType: \"mcp_server\" | \"database\" | \"cache\"\nserviceName: string\nproviderRef: string (provider-specific endpoint/identifier)\nconfig: JSON\nstatus: \"provisioning\" | \"active\" | \"error\" | \"deprovisioned\"\ncreatedAt: number"},{"id":"blk-89389","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-153025","text":"2.5 Runtime Provider Interface Extension"}]},{"id":"blk-89390","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153026","text":"Add to RPI (§20):"}]},{"id":"blk-89391","kind":"code","language":"typescript","text":"interface RuntimeProviderAdapter {\n  // ... existing methods ...\n\n  // Phase 2: MCP sidecar support\n  provisionLinkedService?(agentId: string, service: LinkedServiceConfig): Promise<ServiceRef>;\n  deprovisionLinkedService?(agentId: string, serviceRef: string): Promise<void>;\n  getLinkedServiceEndpoint?(agentId: string, serviceName: string): Promise<string>;\n}"},{"id":"blk-89392","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-153027","text":"3) Agent-to-Agent Skill Routing (A2A)"}]},{"id":"blk-89393","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-153028","text":"3.1 Problem"}]},{"id":"blk-89394","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153029","text":"Currently only human→agent invocation is supported. [&] agents need to invoke skills on other agents (e.g., a fleet coordinator querying a spatial intelligence agent)."}]},{"id":"blk-89395","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-153030","text":"3.2 Solution"}]},{"id":"blk-89396","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153031","text":"Add A2A invocation support using the A2A protocol (agent-to-agent, complementary to MCP):"}]},{"id":"blk-89397","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-89399","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153032","marks":["bold"],"text":"Skill declaration"},{"id":"spn-153033","text":": Agents declare "},{"id":"spn-153034","marks":["code"],"text":"a2a_skills"},{"id":"spn-153035","text":" in their manifest"}]}],"id":"blk-89398","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-89401","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153036","marks":["bold"],"text":"Skill discovery"},{"id":"spn-153037","text":": WHS maintains an internal skill registry (derived from manifests)"}]}],"id":"blk-89400","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-89403","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153038","marks":["bold"],"text":"Skill invocation"},{"id":"spn-153039","text":": Agents can invoke skills on other agents via a WHS-mediated endpoint"}]}],"id":"blk-89402","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-89405","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153040","marks":["bold"],"text":"Governance"},{"id":"spn-153041","text":": All A2A calls pass through Delegatic policy checks"}]}],"id":"blk-89404","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-89406","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-153042","text":"3.3 API Extension"}]},{"id":"blk-89407","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"POST /api/v1/a2a/invoke\n{\n  \"caller_agent_id\": \"agent_abc\",\n  \"skill\": \"fleet-state-enrichment\",\n  \"input\": { ... },\n  \"session_id\": \"optional\"\n}"},{"id":"blk-89408","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153043","text":"WHS resolves the skill to a target agent, checks governance policies, invokes the target, and returns the result."}]},{"id":"blk-89409","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-153044","text":"3.4 Data Model Extension"}]},{"id":"blk-89410","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153045","text":"New table: "},{"id":"spn-153046","marks":["code"],"text":"skillRegistry"}]},{"id":"blk-89411","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"agentId: Id<\"agents\">\nskill: string\ncapability: string (&space.fleet, etc.)\nstatus: \"active\" | \"inactive\""},{"id":"blk-89412","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-153047","text":"4) Governance Enforcement (Delegatic Integration)"}]},{"id":"blk-89413","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-153048","text":"4.1 Problem"}]},{"id":"blk-89414","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153049","text":"WHS currently enforces only tier-based billing limits. [&] agents need governance enforcement: hard/soft constraints, autonomy levels, goal-aware authorization, and audit trails."}]},{"id":"blk-89415","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-153050","text":"4.2 Solution"}]},{"id":"blk-89416","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153051","text":"Integrate with Delegatic for governance:"}]},{"id":"blk-89417","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-89419","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153052","marks":["bold"],"text":"Policy attachment"},{"id":"spn-153053","text":": Link agents to Delegatic org/policy trees"}]}],"id":"blk-89418","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-89421","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153054","marks":["bold"],"text":"Pre-invocation check"},{"id":"spn-153055","text":": Before invoking an agent, check Delegatic policies"}]}],"id":"blk-89420","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-89423","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153056","marks":["bold"],"text":"Audit forwarding"},{"id":"spn-153057","text":": Forward invocation telemetry to Delegatic audit trail"}]}],"id":"blk-89422","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-89425","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153058","marks":["bold"],"text":"Autonomy enforcement"},{"id":"spn-153059","text":": Respect "},{"id":"spn-153060","marks":["code"],"text":"observe | advise | act"},{"id":"spn-153061","text":" autonomy levels from manifests"}]}],"id":"blk-89424","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-89426","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-153062","text":"4.3 Configuration"}]},{"id":"blk-89427","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153063","text":"In "},{"id":"spn-153064","marks":["code"],"text":"ampersand.json"},{"id":"spn-153065","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-89428","kind":"code","language":"json","text":"{\n  \"governance\": {\n    \"delegatic_org_id\": \"org_xyz\",\n    \"autonomy\": \"advise\",\n    \"constraints\": {\n      \"hard\": [\"no_network_without_approval\", \"no_filesystem_write\"],\n      \"soft\": [\"prefer_local_inference\"]\n    }\n  }\n}"},{"id":"blk-89429","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-153066","text":"4.4 Invocation Flow Change"}]},{"id":"blk-89430","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153067","text":"Updated Flow C (Invoke agent):"}]},{"id":"blk-89431","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-89433","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153068","text":"Client calls "},{"id":"spn-153069","marks":["code"],"text":"POST /invoke/:agentId"}]}],"id":"blk-89432","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-89435","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153070","text":"Control plane authenticates/authorizes"}]}],"id":"blk-89434","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-89437","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153071","marks":["bold"],"text":"NEW"},{"id":"spn-153072","text":": If agent has governance config, call Delegatic policy check"}]}],"id":"blk-89436","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-89439","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153073","text":"Check plan limits and agent status"}]}],"id":"blk-89438","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-89441","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153074","text":"Route to runtime provider"}]}],"id":"blk-89440","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-89443","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153075","marks":["bold"],"text":"NEW"},{"id":"spn-153076","text":": Forward telemetry to Delegatic audit"}]}],"id":"blk-89442","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-89445","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153077","text":"Return response"}]}],"id":"blk-89444","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-89446","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-153078","text":"5) Provider Registry (Dynamic Resolution)"}]},{"id":"blk-89447","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-153079","text":"5.1 Problem"}]},{"id":"blk-89448","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153080","text":"Runtime providers (Cloudflare, AgentCore) are hardcoded. [&] agents declare capability providers that should be resolved dynamically (e.g., "},{"id":"spn-153081","marks":["code"],"text":"\"provider\": \"auto\""},{"id":"spn-153082","text":" should resolve to the best available provider for "},{"id":"spn-153083","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-153084","text":")."}]},{"id":"blk-89449","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-153085","text":"5.2 Solution"}]},{"id":"blk-89450","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153086","text":"Add a capability provider registry to WHS:"}]},{"id":"blk-89451","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Provider: graphonomous → Capabilities: [&memory.graph, &memory.consolidate, &reason.deliberate, &reason.attend]\nProvider: ticktickclock → Capabilities: [&time.anomaly, &time.forecast, &time.pattern]\nProvider: geofleetic → Capabilities: [&space.fleet, &space.route, &space.geofence]\nProvider: bendscript → Capabilities: [&memory.graph (KAG)]"},{"id":"blk-89452","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153087","text":"When "},{"id":"spn-153088","marks":["code"],"text":"\"provider\": \"auto\""},{"id":"spn-153089","text":", WHS resolves to the best available provider based on:"}]},{"id":"blk-89453","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-89455","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153090","text":"Capability match"}]}],"id":"blk-89454","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-89457","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153091","text":"Provider availability in deployment region"}]}],"id":"blk-89456","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-89459","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153092","text":"Cost tier of the user's plan"}]}],"id":"blk-89458","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-89461","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153093","text":"Governance constraints"}]}],"id":"blk-89460","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-89462","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-153094","text":"6) Provenance and Audit Trail"}]},{"id":"blk-89463","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-153095","text":"6.1 Problem"}]},{"id":"blk-89464","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153096","text":"Currently invocations have basic "},{"id":"spn-153097","marks":["code"],"text":"traceId"},{"id":"spn-153098","text":" but no hash-linked provenance chain. For [&] agents, every decision should be traceable back through the capability calls that informed it."}]},{"id":"blk-89465","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-153099","text":"6.2 Solution"}]},{"id":"blk-89466","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-153100","text":"Extend telemetry events with provenance fields:"}]},{"id":"blk-89467","kind":"code","language":"typescript","text":"interface TelemetryEvent {\n  // ... existing fields ...\n\n  // [&] provenance extension\n  ampersand?: {\n    capabilities_invoked: string[];      // [\"&memory.graph.recall\", \"&time.anomaly.detect\"]\n    routing_decision: \"fast\" | \"deliberate\";  // κ routing result\n    kappa_value?: number;                // cyclicity score if deliberation was triggered\n    goal_id?: string;      